## Result

**Deliverable:** `/work/submission.csv` — 286,571 rows, columns `id, Will_Buy_EV`, ids identical to `/data/sample_submission.csv` (same order, int64), all predictions probabilities in [0, 1], mean 0.1747 (matches train prior 0.1746 — well calibrated).

## Approach (within ~44 min of 60 min limit)

- **EDA:** no missing values; identical train/test categories; target 17.46% Yes. Strongest signals: `Environmental_Concern_Level`, `Subsidy_Available`, `Home_Charging_Possible`, `Range_Anxiety_Level`; moderate: income, city type.
- **Features:** raw numerics + engineered ratios (`income_per_car`, `income_div_age`, `commute_per_car`, `charging_total`); categoricals handled natively by LightGBM.
- **Model:** LightGBM tuned with Optuna (30 trials), stratified 5-fold CV on ROC-AUC → **CV AUC = 0.9420**.
- **Check:** CatBoost 3-fold CV = 0.9416 → no blend warranted; final model trained on all 668,665 train rows.

## Acceptance criteria

| Criterion | Status | Evidence |
|---|---|---|
| AC1: columns + ids match sample_submission exactly | PASS | `columns == ['id','Will_Buy_EV']`; `sub.id.equals(ss.id)` = True |
| AC2: 286,571 rows, predictions in [0,1] | PASS | shape (286571, 2); between(0,1).all() = True; no NA |
| AC3: CV ROC-AUC reported | PASS | 0.94203 (LightGBM 5-fold, Optuna best trial 21) |

Note: `/work/.harness` was not writable (owned by another uid), so harness state files (`intent.md`, `evidence.md`, `aar.md`) live directly in `/work`; the graded artifact `/work/submission.csv` is in place. Public leaderboard score is unknown (no test targets available); CV is the only signal.
